  ["creature.varnoth.dosi2014"]={title="Varnoth",subtitle="Criatura - DoSI - 2014",body="Pagina: 47\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: humanoid / M\n\nCR: 2\n\nCA: 11\n\nPV: 39 (6d8 + 12)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30\n\nSTR 16 | DEX 13 | CON 14 | INT 10 | WIS 11 | CHA 10\n\nPericias: \n\nIdiomas: Common\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nVarnoth makes three Shortsword attacks.\n\nShortsword\n\nmw 5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. h6 (1d6 + 3) piercing damage."},
  ["creature.varnyr.cm2014"]={title="Varnyr",subtitle="Criatura - CM - 2014",body="Pagina: 63\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: humanoid / M\n\nCR: 1/8\n\nCA: 15\n\nPV: 9 (2d8)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30\n\nSTR 11 | DEX 12 | CON 11 | INT 12 | WIS 14 | CHA 16\n\nPericias: \n\nSentidos: darkvision 60 ft.\n\nIdiomas: Common, Elvish\n\n=== TRACOS ===\n\nFey Ancestry\n\nVarnyr has advantage on saving throws against being charmed, and magic can't put Varnyr to sleep.\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nVarnyr makes two attacks.\n\nCane\n\nmw 3 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. h2 (1d4) bludgeoning damage.\n\n=== REACOES ===\n\nParry\n\nVarnyr adds 2 to their AC against one melee attack that would hit it. To do so, Varnyr must see the attacker and be wielding a melee weapon."},
